From 5fcfaf662ba1c8c1bf985a721e1dec877e6f5383 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 21:07:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): cap and log the spend of chat/MCP integration
 tools

11 read tools (Apollo, Clay, Parallel, Firecrawl/Perplexity, Apify) spent
credits without checking the monthly cap and without being logged, so the
spend meter missed everything done from the chat. executeTool now checks the
cap before the call and logs the approximate spend after it. MCP no longer
marks these tools as read-only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013oUyrHdHaQ4SjMaiyKsvHA
